# Files excluded from `git archive`, i.e. from the QGIS plugin package built by
# `make package`. Without this, `git archive` shipped the ENTIRE repository to
# end users: a 22 MB zip of which ~20 MB was development material (11 MB of
# Jupyter notebooks, the 2.8 MB test fixture raster, CI config, Dockerfiles).
# With it the package is ~1.8 MB.
#
# Nothing listed here is imported by any runtime module — verified by an AST
# scan over every .py in the package (0 unresolved local imports).
#
# NOTE: GitHub's automatic "Source code (zip/tar.gz)" attachments on a Release
# also honour export-ignore, so those will likewise omit tests/ and docs/.
# `git clone` is unaffected and remains the way to get the full repository.

# --- development tooling ---------------------------------------------------
.github/            export-ignore
.gitattributes      export-ignore
.gitignore          export-ignore
CLAUDE.md           export-ignore
Makefile            export-ignore
pb_tool.cfg         export-ignore
plugin_upload.py    export-ignore
pylintrc            export-ignore
setup.cfg           export-ignore

# --- containers / scripts --------------------------------------------------
docker/             export-ignore
Dockerfile          export-ignore
Dockerfile.*        export-ignore
Dockerfile-*        export-ignore
Dockerfile_*        export-ignore
startDocker.sh      export-ignore
scripts/            export-ignore

# --- tests and fixtures (2.8 MB raster + golden GeoPackages) ---------------
tests/              export-ignore
benchmark/          export-ignore

# --- docs, website assets, notebooks ---------------------------------------
docs/               export-ignore
documentation/      export-ignore
standalone/         export-ignore

# --- stale QGIS Plugin Builder boilerplate (GeoApt LLC, 2011-2019) ---------
README.txt          export-ignore
README.html         export-ignore

# --- source for a generated file that IS shipped (resources.py) ------------
resources.qrc       export-ignore
